{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And the woman was left.</b> Alone, without her two children and without her husband. And Scripture mentions her, for such is the rule when Scripture mentions two things, it states [it] of the last. Or it mentions them because of the abundance of her grief over her sons, who were young men, for her husband died old."], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:19.388562911Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}